   ],
   "spoken": "The bishop out to c4 is a different way to handle the Alekhine — prioritising rapid piece development over grabbing the centre with pawns. It carries a sacrificial idea against f7 to stay alert for."
  },
  {
   "ply": 8,
   "t": 1358.5,
