   "line": [
    "e6"
   ],
   "spoken": "Wary of a trap, prop the centralised knight with a pawn — passive, but rock-solid. There's real merit in openings where you sit slightly worse yet remain almost impossible to break down.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 9,
